# /give 不给数据值时，显示名用的是哪个数据值的。
#
# 2026-10-21 真服实测（协议机器人在线，探针 -Bot Steve）：
#   give Steve minecraft:dye 1     -> ?
#   give Steve minecraft:banner 1   -> ?
#   give Steve minecraft:bed 1      -> ?
#   give Steve minecraft:potion 1   -> ?
#
# 要回答的是：命令里没写数据值的时候，物品堆的数据值是 0 还是别的，
# 显示名跟着哪个走。

--- console ---
say Y01
give Steve minecraft:dye 1
say Y02
give Steve minecraft:banner 1
say Y03
give Steve minecraft:bed 1
say Y04
give Steve minecraft:potion 1
say Y05
give Steve minecraft:skull 1
say Y06
give Steve minecraft:wool 1
say Y07
